{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Nature Escapes 5, where the peaceful world of hidden objects awaits. With 24 new levels, each one is a quiet corner of nature where you can take your time and enjoy the simple act of finding hidden objects. It\u2019s a casual game designed for those moments when you just want to relax and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/extras/iln5_gif_03.gif?t=1729643335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore, you\u2019ll discover objects nestled in beautiful, serene settings. Whether it's a tranquil forest or a blooming garden, each level offers a calm, unhurried experience. And if you enjoy a bit of creativity, there's plenty of opportunity to expand your garden with new plants and decorations, making it a little retreat that reflects the world you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/extras/iln5_gif_02.gif?t=1729643335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/extras/iln5_gif_01.gif?t=1729643335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nature Escapes 5 is all about taking it easy and enjoying a bit of peace and quiet of nature .</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blooming Guru","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/5054a392e87477a0035aceb7124ede74fb4e4d57.jpg"},{"name":"Botanical Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/73ec5826428f35e1ac55ff61f2b116a281aef51a.jpg"},{"name":"Nature's Fanatic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/9d3146b2983b1f0fbc3c58c795882f2ac9f54161.jpg"},{"name":"Green Father","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/9c07624257ae0532921685bbf090df2f1dede19a.jpg"},{"name":"Foliage Whispers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/601b3ed98552099c3a7c58000d7d228ac0f060f2.jpg"},{"name":"Sneaky Bee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/908ee872e25449f1a8805a329046005d9ea4c660.jpg"},{"name":"Planter's Keepers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/1c6d41d63340425fc59b551ca733e9e64a64954a.jpg"},{"name":"Helpful Sun Rays","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/a69234c40ed34ee2aeab002bb803c86b7a032631.jpg"},{"name":"Shutterbug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/a3b5cc45eb3223d6539b1e2229cf7a497611fe6d.jpg"},{"name":"Minty Snap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2710090/a3499f0261d0ff53bd1dacf14baa0e295b23ee7a.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2710090?t=1729643335","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1729643335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1729643335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1729643335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find yourself in 20+ cozy, nature-inspired levels. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover over 70+ hidden object scenes and engaging minigames. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn fascinating facts about a diverse array of plants. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax with soothing, gentle music throughout your journey. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and personalize your own peaceful garden retreat.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Nature Escapes 5, where the peaceful world of hidden objects awaits. With 24 new levels, each one is a quiet corner of nature where you can take your time and enjoy the simple act of finding hidden objects. It\u2019s a casual game designed for those moments when you just want to relax and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/extras/iln5_gif_03.gif?t=1729643335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore, you\u2019ll discover objects nestled in beautiful, serene settings. Whether it's a tranquil forest or a blooming garden, each level offers a calm, unhurried experience. And if you enjoy a bit of creativity, there's plenty of opportunity to expand your garden with new plants and decorations, making it a little retreat that reflects the world you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/extras/iln5_gif_02.gif?t=1729643335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710090/extras/iln5_gif_01.gif?t=1729643335\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nature Escapes 5 is all about taking it easy and enjoying a bit of peace and quiet of nature .</p>","developers":["Tiny Little Lion"],"genres":[{"descr